Each application, content package, and shared crate in this repository carries
the license of its source project. The root repository does not relicense those
components.

Applications:
- apps/doom: GPL-2.0; see apps/doom/LICENSE.
- apps/quake: GPL-2.0-or-later; see apps/quake/LICENSE.
- apps/duke3d: GPL-2.0-or-later; see apps/duke3d/LICENSE.
- apps/nes: GPL-2.0 through the pinned FCEUmm source; see its vendor Copying file.
- apps/egui-kitchen-sink, apps/gpu-cube, apps/scene-lab: MPL-2.0.

Content:
- content/freedoom: BSD-3-Clause; the official package supplies COPYING and credits.
- content/librequake: BSD-3-Clause and GPL-2.0-or-later; the pinned release supplies COPYING, license details, and credits.
- content/libresector: CC0-1.0; see content/libresector/LICENSE.
- content/nes-controller-test: MIT; see content/nes-controller-test/LICENSE.
- content/duke3d-shareware: governed by the unmodified shareware archive's LICENSE.TXT; no archive is committed.

Shared runtime contracts and PolkaVM-derived artifacts retain their upstream
MPL-2.0, MIT, and Apache-2.0 notices under licenses/ and in generated bundles.
